From 7044e8a79a06984f15ed7214e8c2496114dc83f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dave Stevenson <dave.stevenson@raspberrypi.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:11:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] media: sony-starvis2: Fixup imx585 configuration

The common registers and minimum HMAX values merged for IMX585 were
incorrect. Validate against the information from Sony, and confirmed
working.

Fixes: bcb59d4f4afe ("media: sony-starvis2: Add support for IMX585")

Signed-off-by: Dave Stevenson <dave.stevenson@raspberrypi.com>
